{"about_the_game":"What's on Mate'Morphosis Demo: You may experience the first 16 levels of the full game, some polish and features like localization are not available in demo. <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081650/extras/f2b5b324c791d23b11948348b6380624.poster.avif?t=1759659623\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081650/extras/f2b5b324c791d23b11948348b6380624.webm?t=1759659623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME WHAT YOU CAPTURE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mate Morphosis is a <strong>chess puzzle game</strong> about navigating <strong>ONE PIECE</strong> to capture queen. It is all about turning into the piece you just took. Every capture changes how you move, so you plan few turn ahead and plot sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081650/extras/0a7427e4d245140f9471ca87f24f571e.poster.avif?t=1759659623\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081650/extras/0a7427e4d245140f9471ca87f24f571e.webm?t=1759659623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MORPH NOW &amp; Much More</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morph</strong> - Pawns become knights, knights become bishops; your route evolves with every move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving mechanics</strong> - Fresh mechanics beyond chess keep boards surprising from start to Mate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted challenge</strong> - tight levels with a steady difficulty climb and clean, readable pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant learning loop</strong> - quick restarts and fast pacing make puzzle experience painless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play your way</strong> - <span class=\"bb_strike\">A lot potential moves</span>.\u00a0<i><u>well kinda</u>.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081650/extras/f21f4a6264afa748f34a6c85c7a4b5b8.poster.avif?t=1759659623\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081650/extras/f21f4a6264afa748f34a6c85c7a4b5b8.webm?t=1759659623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Once Wise Monke Said:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pawns dream of becoming knights, and I dream bananas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081650?t=1759659623","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081650?t=1759659623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081650/82dcdda17019d18a760e0268f9bc4846ef15c9b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759659623","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081650/82dcdda17019d18a760e0268f9bc4846ef15c9b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759659623","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"descriptio